BT /F1 10 Tf 62 572 Td (- Load hot-100-80s.csv into a SQLite database named hot100-80s.db.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 553 Td (- Provide a Streamlit app with a main page, year page, song page, and common navigation menu.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 534 Td (- Set the Streamlit page title to 'Welcome to the 80s Hot 100 Charts'.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 515 Td (- On the main page, show the top 10 most successful songs of all time using a score based on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 501 Td (Hot 100 position and time on chart.) Tj ET
