BT /F2 15 Tf 54 730 Td (How To Run) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 706 Td (- Install dependencies with: pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 687 Td (- Rebuild the database when the CSV changes with: python3 load_hot100.py) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 668 Td (- Start the app with: streamlit run app.py) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 649 Td (- If streamlit is not on PATH, use: python3 -m streamlit run app.py) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 630 Td (- Open the local URL printed by Streamlit, commonly http://localhost:8501 or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 616 Td (http://127.0.0.1:8501.) Tj ET
