BT /F1 10 Tf 62 540 Td (background image remains visible on all pages with an overlay that preserves readability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 521 Td (- On Year Page, select a year from the dropdown. The highest available year is selected by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 507 Td (default.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 488 Td (- Click a song button in the top 50 report to open that song on the Song Page.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 62 469 Td (- On Song Page, the dropdown can also be used to select any song directly.) Tj ET
